<h1 id=3D"Authorization-Requirements">Requirements</h1>
<ol>
 <li>Fine Grained control for API access. Managing and providing API role t=
o permissions mapping.</li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"Authorization-OutofScope">Out of Scope</h2>
<ol>
 <li>All use-cases of Sub-advising</li>
 <li>All use-cases of parent firm</li>
 <li>All use-cases of division / branch</li>
 <li>All use-cases of multiple primary firms</li>
</ol>
