<h2 id=3D"Authorization-Setup">Setup</h2>
<h3 id=3D"Authorization-Okta-UserAccess">Okta - User Access</h3>
<ol>
 <li>User will have user-groups. multiplicity =3D 1:M</li>
 <li>user-group will have scopes, multiplicity =3D 1:M (One per API)</li>
</ol>
